"""
K5D Autonomous Robot Agent — Prolabs V12.2
Transforms the original "plan once → execute blindly" architecture into:
OBSERVE → THINK → PLAN → ACT → OBSERVE → REPLAN

Modules:
  WorldModel   — persistent object graph with rich properties
  Memory       — task history, goals, failures, observations
  Validator    — pre-execution command validation
  Planner      — Claude-powered multi-turn reasoning loop
  Executor     — structured feedback from each action step
  K5DServer    — HTTP server wiring it all together
"""

