2. Always visit an object's exact location before picking up
3. Only hold one object at a time
4. Pair every {press} with {un_press} once done
5. Return tools (soap, cloth, watering can) to their original location after use
6. End with {task_completed}

## Object Type Aliases
bottle / water_bottle = bottle
cup / coffee_cup = mug
flower / pot = plant
dish = plate
drawer / shelf = box

## Workflow Recipes (adapt based on what's actually available)

### move object
